<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The notice under subsection (3) shall state that, unless the participant satisfies the Director General that the obligations will be dealt with according to the relevant law or the restrictions will be complied with, the Director General shall take such action as he considers reasonably necessary to ensure that they are dealt with according to the law or complied with."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_14> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
