<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_15__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_15__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purpose of this section, “participant” includes a person who was provided with a new identity under the Programme and is no longer a participant. Termination of protection and assistance"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
