<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_16__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Attorney General upon receiving the recommendation under subsection (1) shall decide whether or not to terminate the protection and assistance provided to the participant under the Programme."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
