<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_16__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Attorney General shall give a participant an opportunity to be heard before making his decision under subsection (2)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_16__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_16> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
