<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_16__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The provisions of subsection (3) shall not apply where the Attorney General does not know the participant’s whereabouts."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_16__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_16> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
