<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_16__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subsection (1), a participant may make a request in writing to the Director General that the protection and assistance provided under the Programme be terminated by the Attorney General."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
