<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may appoint a Director General and a Deputy Director General of Witness Protection from amongst members of the public services."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
