<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may appoint such other person or persons, as he deems fit, to assist the Director General in carrying out the purposes of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
