<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any witness may apply to the Director General to be included in the Programme."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
