<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_17__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_17__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be punished with imprisonment for a term not exceeding twenty years. Director General not required to disclose information"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
