<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_18__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "to produce in any proceedings in a court, tribunal, Commission or an inquiry, any document that has come into the custody or control of the Director General or his officer; or"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
