<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_18__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "to divulge or communicate to such a body any matter or thing that has come to the notice of the Director General or any of his officer, in the performance of their functions and duties under this Act, except where it is necessary to do so for carrying out the purposes of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_18__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_18> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/31/eng@> .
